 "title": "Recorder Fees Schedule Update – Dunklin County",
 "text": "Recorder Fees Schedule Update – Dunklin County\nHome\nCourthouse\nDunklin County Assessor\nDunklin County Clerk\nDunklin County Collector & Treasurer\nDunklin County Economic Development\nDunklin County Public Administrator\nDunklin County Recorder of Deeds\nJuvenile Office 35th Judicial Circuit Court\nJustice Center\nDunklin County 911\nDunklin County Circuit Clerk\nDunklin County Emergency Management Agency\nDunklin County Judicial System\nDunklin County Prosecuting Attorney\nDunklin County Sheriff’s Office\nPhone Directory\nCounty Commission\nElection Information\nHome\nCourthouse\nDunklin County Assessor\nDunklin County Clerk\nDunklin County Collector & Treasurer\nDunklin County Economic Development\nDunklin County Public Administrator\nDunklin County Recorder of Deeds\nJuvenile Office 35th Judicial Circuit Court\nJustice Center\nDunklin County 911\nDunklin County Circuit Clerk\nDunklin County Emergency Management Agency\nDunklin County Judicial System\nDunklin County Prosecuting Attorney\nDunklin County Sheriff’s Office\nPhone Directory\nCounty Commission\nElection Information\nFOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE\nStandard Fee Adjustments Effective August 28, 2026, Under Missouri SB 938\nFollowing the passage of Missouri Senate Bill 938, a flat $2.00 statutory fee increase will take effect statewide on August 28, 2026, for recording documents, marriage licenses, and land surveys/plats.\nRecorders of Deeds across Missouri will update their office policies to comply with these statutory changes, which will take effect August 28, 2026.\nThe Recorders Association of Missouri and all county Recorders are committed to upholding the statutory requirements of their offices, and these changes will be implemented promptly upon the law's effective date.\nFor specific local page by page pricing or questions, please contact your local Recorder of Deeds.\nDunklin County Recorder of Deeds\nFee Schedule\nAs of August 28, 2026\n# of Pages | Fee |\n1 | $26.00 |\n2 | $29.00 |\n3 | $32.00 |\n4 | $35.00 |\n5 | $38.00 |\n6 | $41.00 |\n7 | $44.00 |\n8 | $47.00 |\n9 | $50.00 |\n10 | $53.00 |\n11 | $56.00 |\n12 | $59.00 |\n13 | $62.00 |\n14 | $65.00 |\n15 | $68.00 |\n16 | $71.00 |\n17 | $74.00 |\n18 | $77.00 |\n19 | $80.00 |\n20 | $83.00 |\nPlats\n18×24 | $46.00 first page / $25.00 each additional |\n24×36 | $71.00 first page / $50.00 each additional |\nSurveys\n18×24 | $26.00 first page / $5.00 each additional |\n24×36 | $31.00 first page / $5.00 each additional |\nDunklin County Courthouse\n100 Kennett Court Square\nKennett, MO 63857\nDunklin County Justice Center\n1175 Floyd Street\nKennett, MO 63857\nQuick Links\nDunklin County 911\nAssessor\nCircuit Clerk\nCounty Clerk\nCollector/Treasurer\nEconomic Development\nJudicial System\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder of Deeds\nSheriff’s Office\nJuvenile Office\nUseful Links\nMissouri Secretary of State\nFEMA Disaster Assistance\nMissouri Association of Counties\nMissouri Department of Health and Senior Services\nMissouri Department of Mental Health\nHelpful Links\nDunklin County Employment\n© All Rights Reserved. Designed by Thin Blue Technologies",
